// --- Part 2: finished-event signal (v8) ---
// Every event type stores its result through the setter 001333D0, called from the pass-through at
// 00115A50. That call (00115A60) now goes through a stub at 000FF100 that, before continuing into the
// setter, writes to the mod's data page:
//   000FE100  finished-event counter (+1 per stored result)
//   000FE104  rating tier just stored
//   000FE108  medal just stored
patch=1,EE,000FF100,word,3C08000F
patch=1,EE,000FF104,word,3508E100
patch=1,EE,000FF108,word,8D090000
patch=1,EE,000FF10C,word,25290001
